Brand and Logo Exclusion

The contents of the `brand/` directory — including but not limited to the
emblem ("Drake"), logo, and lockup artwork (all `brand/logo/**` files, in
particular `brand/logo/drake/architects-overlay-drake.svg` and
`brand/logo/drake/lockup-horizontal.svg` and their rendered PNG exports) —
are NOT licensed under the MIT License above.

All rights in the brand assets remain with the project author
(Semih Balci / SeBoOne). Reproduction, redistribution, modification, or any
use of the brand assets outside of this project, or to imply endorsement or
affiliation, is not permitted without prior written permission.

Exception: personal, non-commercial reference to the project by name or by
showing the unmodified logo when linking to the official repository
(https://github.com/SeBoOne/architects-overlay) is fine.
